# SHA-256 of gate 4's fixtures — the eight deterministic vectors
# sw/board_gate_extract.py runs against.  557,136 bytes total.
#
# WHY THESE ARE COMMITTED AND HASHED.  A board result means nothing unless it
# can be tied to the exact bytes that produced it, and these vectors are
# GENERATED — regenerating them on the board would let the gate agree with
# whatever it had just made.  Same discipline as BUILD_INFO.txt for the
# .bit/.hwh pair: the payload is pinned, and the gate refuses to run if the
# copies it finds do not match this record.
#
# The generators are deterministic and self-checking (pe_tme_generate_golden
# pins BPE_HASHES and BPE_CASES_SHA256; a regeneration that differs from this
# file means an oracle changed, not that the files drifted).  Regenerate with:
#     cd hls/integration    && python3 pe_tme_generate_golden.py
#     cd hls/template_match && python3 tme_generate_golden.py
#
# The three tb_tme_*_hw.* files are byte-identical to the vectors that passed
# 9/9 on silicon on 2026-08-07 (contract §8) — verified, not assumed.
#
# .gitattributes marks all eight `-text` so a Windows checkout cannot
# EOL-normalise a manifest and invalidate its hash.
#
# Verify by hand with:  sha256sum -c GATE4_VECTORS.sha256   (from the dir
# holding the copies; the paths below are repo-relative for provenance and
# the basenames are what the gate looks for).
#
# tb_bpe_tme_cases.txt  (141 B) — three-stage manifest: 1 descriptor, 24x20 page, threshold 140
ed90565eec56a4aa816d7ba12f64a146cabb95b58548254f304d65ba111a740b  hls/integration/tb_bpe_tme_cases.txt
# tb_bpe_tme_gray.bin  (480 B) — 24x20 grayscale input to binarize_core
ede44a0efa7757102f18bd583983d4b262a6e5f7141bd5a13302d8be555573b3  hls/integration/tb_bpe_tme_gray.bin
# tb_bpe_tme_bin.bin  (480 B) — 480-byte compact binarizer golden
118ac39fb5cfed72a7e024cddee9045ae43157710600e0772f91fe50bd829a57  hls/integration/tb_bpe_tme_bin.bin
# tb_bpe_tme_patch.bin  (168 B) — 168-byte 14x12 extractor patch golden at (3,4)
3a97be1698cea0fc1805683ccba6f2e62b4ed1742196023b561e7b9e5ba47c0d  hls/integration/tb_bpe_tme_patch.bin
# tb_bpe_tme_templs.bin  (16 B) — literal 4x4 matcher template (the exact crop at local (4,1))
f00dc88ec2407e1e83e7a0c43949506f46f526b586c2bcc7c2990c35b5d24f8f  hls/integration/tb_bpe_tme_templs.bin
